From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xucy <xucy0609@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 01 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Chunk Region (consolidated)

Consolidated from 9 original patches:
  - 0002-Threading-utilities.patch: Threading utilities
  - 0021-Add-tick-regions-api.patch: Add tick regions api
  - 0022-Add-tpsbar-with-chunkhot-membar-and-regionbar.patch: Add tpsbar with chunkhot, membar and regionbar
  - 0034-Leaf-Secure-seed-and-matter-seed-command.patch: Leaf: Secure seed and matter seed command
  - 0056-Force-disable-builtin-spark-plugin.patch: Force disable builtin spark plugin
  - 0068-Improved-Server-Health-Report.patch: Improved Server Health Report
  - 0090-Do-not-load-too-far-poi-chunk-in-poi-compete-scan.patch: Do not load too far poi chunk in poi compete scan
  - 0102-Leaves-Replay-Mod-API.patch: Leaves: Replay Mod API
  - 0112-Add-null-check-in-RegionizedWorldData-conections.patch: Add-null-check-in-RegionizedWorldData-conections


